    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Two assistant professors at AKU's Medical College East Africa, Dr Catherine Gathu and Dr Elizabeth Kagotho, have been listed in Business Daily's  Top 40 Under 40 Women  2024 . They have made significant contributions to Kenya's healthcare sector, with their career journeys rooted in passion and dedication.",
